      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2749,
        "name": "食谱：奶香菌菇脆塔",
        "desc": "<p>步骤详实的食谱，记载着「奶香菌菇脆塔」的制作方法。</p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_6421825083493558464.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "需要食材"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1737,
        "name": "面粉",
        "desc": "由小麦磨成的粉末。无论做成怎样的主食，都能给食客的胃带来片刻充实。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Flour_icon.png",
        "amount": 4,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 1555,
        "name": "蘑菇",
        "desc": "生命力旺盛的常见菌类。只要拥有适宜的荫蔽与水分，在何处都能蓬勃生长。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Mushroom_icon.png",
        "amount": 3,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 603,
        "name": "奶酪",
        "desc": "由牛奶浓缩发酵制成的奶制品。提供热量的同时，赋予了烹饪无限可能性。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cheese_icon.png",
        "amount": 2,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 602,
        "name": "奶油",
        "desc": "将牛奶快速搅拌后提制的奶制品。是制作美味糕点时必备的材料之一。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Cream_icon.png",
        "amount": 1,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "相关料理"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2791,
        "name": "奶香菌菇脆塔",
        "desc": "<p>口感酥脆的小吃。在面包片上放上食材和奶酪，烘烤而成。仅是闻到香气，便令人满心期待，一口下去，鲜美中满口尽是令人无法抗拒的香甜。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/f2b672baaaad68fad73aad1ec9f4adce_5017454648949001726.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2790,
        "name": "奇怪的奶香菌菇脆塔",
        "desc": "<p>口感酥脆的小吃。从配菜的干瘪憔悴中看出放置时间已久，面包片失去了水分，变得又干又硬，一口下去，腮颊隐隐发酸···下次要记得趁热吃···</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/beaef7ff5c8bf1d2a85f18490f45ee5c_1110758891698130219.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 2789,
        "name": "美味的奶香菌菇脆塔",
        "desc": "<p>口感酥脆的小吃。若有似无的奶香在舌尖微微化开，柔韧的菌菇与其融合，随着松脆面包片的咔嚓咔嚓声···这无与伦比的满足感，让人连指尖残留的面包屑都不想要放过。</p><p></p>",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/08/88072335/862142a2b9fdf57717191d141a314a0a_4816321015068157363.png",
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
