        "desc": "步骤详实的食谱，记载着「轻策农家菜」的制作方法。",
        "iconUrl": "https://upload-static.hoyoverse.com/hoyolab-wiki/2023/03/25/88072335/60c9c277139b43907167e6452d409874_2690633697591738499.png",
